body:
closes https://github.com/PrefectHQ/prefect/issues/22725

Two ui-v2 fixes:

1. `SchemaFormInputArrayList.handleValueChange` only updated local state and never called `onValuesChange`, so editing a list item never reached the form. A newly added item stayed at its `undefined` initial value, submitting `[null]`; adding/deleting a second item happened to flush the local state, which is why that was the reported workaround.

```diff
 function handleValueChange(key: string, value: unknown) {
-  setLocalKeyedValues(localKeyedValues.map(...));
+  const newKeyedValues = localKeyedValues.map(...);
+  setLocalKeyedValues(newKeyedValues);
+  onValuesChange(newKeyedValues.map(({ value }) => value));
 }
```
   `isEmpty` / `canAddMore` / `getLastForIndex` now derive from `localKeyedValues` (the source of truth for rendered rows) instead of the `values` prop.

2. Deployment names in the flow detail deployments table are now links to `/deployments/deployment/$id`, and the table supports row clicks, matching the deployments table.

### Checklist

- [x] This pull request references any related issue by including "closes `<link to issue>`"
- [x] If this pull request adds or changes functionality, it includes tests or explains why tests are not needed.
- [x] If this pull request changes user-facing behavior, it updates documentation or explains why documentation is not needed. (bug fix, no docs)


